1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:05,063
Abraham Lincoln was president for one
thousand five hundred and three days.

2
00:00:05,323 --> 00:00:08,393
Put the Civil War on a track of its own,
and it covers one thousand four hundred

3
00:00:08,443 --> 00:00:13,044
and fifty-eight of them.
Ninety-seven percent.

4
00:00:13,274 --> 00:00:16,894
At the start, thirty-nine days: from
his inauguration to the guns at Fort

5
00:00:16,944 --> 00:00:18,173
Sumter.

6
00:00:18,513 --> 00:00:23,083
And at the end, six. Lee
surrendered on April the ninth.

7
00:00:23,133 --> 00:00:26,597
Lincoln was shot on the fourteenth,
and died the next morning.

8
00:00:26,857 --> 00:00:30,757
His whole life is on this timeline,
every date with its source.

9
00:00:30,807 --> 00:00:33,211
It's free, on OpenChronology.
